<h1>How to Fetch a Full Kundali Report & Dynamic 5-Level Dasha Tree (Prana Dasha) in Dart / Flutter</h1>

<p>This complete step-by-step integration tutorial demonstrates how to set up, integrate, and build a full Vedic Astrology system using the <strong>Jyothisya API</strong> via RapidAPI inside a <strong>Dart or Flutter</strong> application. You will learn how to generate a complete Kundali report and dynamically calculate a <strong>5-Level Vimshottari Dasha Tree (down to Prana Dasha)</strong> using pure Dart code.</p>

